  "prefLabel": "Gcd 102.01 Accessible building",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gcd 102.01 \"Accessible building\" means \"accessible building\" as defined in RSA 275-C:9, I (b), namely \"a building which, in the determination of the governor's commission on disability, is accessible to elderly persons and persons with disabilities.\"\n\nSource. #7634, eff 1-30-02; ss by #10338, eff 5-17-13",
